{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And all your valuations shall be in the sacred shekel.</b> Every valuation of yours in which shekels are written shall be in the sacred shekel." "<b>Twenty gerah.</b> Twenty ma'ot — so it was originally. Afterward they added a sixth. And our Sages said: six ma'ah of silver is a dinar; twenty-four ma'ot to the sela (see Bekhorot 50a)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:58.460177001Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}